      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le concept se passe d’explications, mais je suis\nd’humeur bavarde, alors permets-moi d’élaborer.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLors des Grands Jeux de Violine ∞, je serai ta\nseule et unique adversaire.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTon objectif est simple : tu devras me battre\nencore et encore à l’infini ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 260
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans ma grande bonté, j’enregistrerai ton plus\ngrand nombre de victoires d’affilée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ton plus grand nombre de victoires d’affilée\nest de <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002> .<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006E00200070006C007500730020006700720061006E00640020006E006F006D00620072006500200064006500200076006900630074006F00690072006500730020006420190061006600660069006C00E90065000A006500730074002000640065002000100003020500020020002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Souhaites-tu participer aux Grands Jeux de\nVioline ∞ ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F0075006800610069007400650073002D007400750020007000610072007400690063006900700065007200200061007500780020004700720061006E006400730020004A006500750078002000640065000A00560069006F006C0069006E00650020221E0020003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En quoi ça consiste, déjà ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000710075006F0069002000E7006100200063006F006E00730069007300740065002C0020006400E9006A00E00020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je passe mon tour pour cette fois.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007000610073007300650020006D006F006E00200074006F0075007200200070006F0075007200200063006500740074006500200066006F00690073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ta réponse me ravit !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400610020007200E90070006F006E007300650020006D00650020007200610076006900740020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien ! Profitons ensemble de cet affrontement\nnº <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002>  !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00200021002000500072006F006600690074006F006E007300200065006E00730065006D0062006C0065002000640065002000630065007400200061006600660072006F006E00740065006D0065006E0074000A006E00BA0020001000030205000200200020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à participer !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E0002000700061007200740069006300690070006500720020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bravo, c’était remarquable ! ♥\nPassons au combat suivant, si tu le veux bien !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
